# .claude/ holds the local dev tooling a fresh clone needs: the preview server
# (npm run serve), the Browser-pane launch config, the build specs and the
# copy-review skill. It is tracked since 26 Sep 2026, when sessions moved to
# fresh clones on the desktop; before that it was shared by sharing the folder.
# It is kept OUT OF THE DEPLOY by .vercelignore and a forced 404 in
# netlify.toml, because the repo root is the served site.
#
# Still ignored inside it: personal permissions, generated output, and scratch.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/copy-dump.txt
.claude/copy-review/
.claude/v3-preview.html
.claude/tmp-*

# Installed by Vercel at build time from package-lock.json; never committed.
node_modules/
